    "results_timeline_mqixwX": {
      "type": "results-timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "stage_jgigcJ": {
          "type": "stage",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Stir-in.jpg",
            "chip": "Weeks 1–2",
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "studies_label": "",
            "studies_text": "Getting the habit right is what makes weeks 6–12 work.",
            "overlay_grad": "#1a2874",
            "overlay_text": "#ffffff",
            "customers_label": "Customers report:",
            "customers_text": "Cravings and food noise are the first thing our customers mention.",
            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>I've been using Bodology's inositol for a few weeks, and I already notice a difference - fewer cravings and less PMS.</p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic.png",
            "quote_name": "Beverley O.",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 5,
            "quote_text_2": "<p>Its been a few weeks since starting this brand and I am happy with the product. It helps balance out cravings and keeps insulin in check, supports my PCOS and hormones during perimenopause.</p>",
            "quote_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Profile_pic_4.png",
            "quote_name_2": "Lisa F.",
            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>After seeing reviews about better sleep & mood, I decided to try this powder even though I don't have PCOS. I've been taking one scoop in the morning and one before bed for the past few weeks. Since taking Bodology I'm waking up a lot less in the night, and falling asleep much easier. I'd also say I generally feel much calmer and focused for the whole day. Haven't experienced any negative side effects.</p>",
            "quote_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_2.png",
            "quote_name_3": "Bonnie H.",
            "quote_role_3": "Verified buyer",
            "btn_label": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        },
        "stage_hzQ9Fx": {
          "type": "stage",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Bodology_Inositol_Results_Smile_11638a8f-c8d3-4360-9a8a-b1c21351c7be.png",
            "chip": "Weeks 3–6",
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "studies_label": "",
            "studies_text": "This is the earliest point ovulation has been recorded in trial.",
            "overlay_grad": "#1a2874",
            "overlay_text": "#ffffff",
            "customers_label": "Customers report:",
            "customers_text": "Cravings and afternoon crashes ease. Some see a first cycle.",
            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>Everything has improved after 4+ weeks of taking inositol. Food noise has gone down, less afternoon crashes, period is back.</p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_2.png",
            "quote_name": "Lilianna",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 3,
            "quote_text_2": "<p>I have been using this just under a month. I have noticed some differences regarding appetite control and less snacking urges.</p>",
            "quote_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Profile_pic_4.png",
            "quote_name_2": "Breanne O.",
            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>I have PCOS (PMOS) and have irregular cycles, in the last few months I have gone more than 3 months without my period. I started taking Bodology inositol on 07/22/2026 the day after I received the product, and just 2 weeks and a few days later on 08/08/26 I got my menstrual period. I couldn't believe it, but it happened. This is an incredible product, and so easy to take daily.</p>",
            "quote_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic.png",
            "quote_name_3": "Rachel S.",
            "quote_role_3": "Verified buyer",
            "btn_label": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        },
        "stage_hFeq4x": {
          "type": "stage",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Relief.png",
            "chip": "Weeks 3–6",
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "studies_label": "",
            "studies_text": "This is when ovulation improvements have been recorded.*",
            "overlay_grad": "#1a2874",
            "overlay_text": "#ffffff",
            "customers_label": "What our customers report:",
            "customers_text": "Cravings settle. A subset see a first cycle. Energy and afternoon crashes shift.",
            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>I started taking bodology inositol on 07/22/2026... and just 2 weeks and a few days later on 08/08/26 I got my menstrual period</p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_2.png",
            "quote_name": "Angeli C.",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 5,
            "quote_text_2": "",
            "quote_name_2": "",
            "quote_role_2": "",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "",
            "quote_name_3": "",
            "quote_role_3": "",
            "btn_label": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        },
        "stage_wxj9mC": {
          "type": "stage",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Bodology-Inositol-Empowered-2_f4e75ba5-b9b5-4b5c-a608-708cd3ea6ef6.png",
            "chip": "Weeks 6–12",
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "studies_label": "",
            "studies_text": "Studies measure cycle regularity, weight and hormone balance.",
            "overlay_grad": "#1a2874",
            "overlay_text": "#ffffff",
            "customers_label": "Customers report:",
            "customers_text": "Mood steadies before cycles do. Weight starts moving for some.",
            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>I usually don't buy into supplements, but after reading into Bodology's inositol powder... I decided to give it a try.... the differences I have noticed are game changing. Leading up to my cycle, my mood is noticeably more stable, I'm not rampantly eating and snacking and craving, and my cycles aren't as intense as they previously had been. I'm I'm halfway through my second canister and don't plant to stop. </p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic.png",
            "quote_name": "Samantha A",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 5,
            "quote_text_2": "<p>I love it! I have tried other brands and then I found this one through my sister in law and I have been taking it for a couple months now and I have definitely seen a change in my mood as which is a very important thing for me.</p>",
            "quote_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_3.png",
            "quote_name_2": "Zoey W.",
            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>Bodology is truly life changing!! Inositol has helped me so much with my PMDD, cramps, and irregular cycle. I love this brand because it doesn't have any fillers or additives which is hard to find these days and it's super high quality. It's so easy to use in the powdered form too, I just add it to smoothies and matcha, makes it so easy!</p>",
            "quote_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_2.png",
            "quote_name_3": "Kylie S.",
            "quote_role_3": "Verified buyer",
            "btn_label": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        },
        "stage_fPhY4C": {
          "type": "stage",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-08-26_at_9.13.59_PM.png",
            "chip": "Week 12+",
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "studies_label": "",
            "studies_text": "Studies support androgen reduction and egg quality.",
            "overlay_grad": "#1a2874",
            "overlay_text": "#ffffff",
            "customers_label": "Customers report:",
            "customers_text": "The slowest changes show up here — and the early ones hold.",
            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>I started using Bodology's inositol powder several months ago... I've had fewer sugar cravings, even during my luteal phase, more stable blood sugar levels, and fewer afternoon energy crashes. My menstrual cycles have also become much easier, with little to no PMS—an incredible relief! This product is truly a game-changer... I absolutely love it!</p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_3.png",
            "quote_name": "Keira K.",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 5,
            "quote_text_2": "<p>While taking this I have lost 11 lbs and I feel it has supported me well during my IVF journey! I love this product! I was previously using a different brand but once I learned this was women owned and created, affordable, and has a good taste I was sold. I have used this in my morning yogurt, smoothies, water, tea, etc!</p>",
            "quote_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Profile_pic_4.png",
            "quote_name_2": "Katelyn K",
            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>I haven't had any clearly identifiable side effects, which I am thankful for. It has caused me to steadily lose weight over the five months I have used it so far. Given that I wasn't able to lose much on GLP1s, this is a rather welcome effect that seems to be continuing.</p>",
            "quote_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic.png",
            "quote_name_3": "Andrea H.",
            "quote_role_3": "Verified buyer",
            "btn_label": "",
            "btn_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
